Source: https://boringssl.googlesource.com/boringssl
Tag: 0.20260413.0
Commit: 78f7fbeec98a2fb15acea6f7a9f1def7f2e6d9a0
Patches: patches/boringssl

BoringSSL does not provide stability-branch semantics. Upstream periodic
0.YYYYMMDD.N tags are snapshots for consumers that need tags; Collo pins this
snapshot and should update intentionally.

Consumed as a shallow checkout of this commit (`zig build deps-provision`).
`zig build boringssl` applies the series to a worktree of the commit and
builds `libssl.a` and `libcrypto.a` with CMake into
`runtime/deps/boringssl-build/<triple>/`; the checkout itself is never
edited.
